    <string name="onboarding_page_1">Chess Arrows places a small floating pencil over your chess app. Draw moves, threats and ideas without leaving the game.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page_2">Tap the pencil to start drawing. Drag to create arrows. Release to place.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page_3">Use the undo button to remove the last arrow. Use the clear button to remove all arrows.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page_4">Adjust color, width and opacity in the settings. Changes apply immediately.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page_5">The overlay works over any chess app. No accessibility service needed.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page_6">Tap the switch to enable the overlay. Grant permission when prompted.</string>
